  - characterName: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi ch\u01A1i"
    dialogText: "Th\u1EED m\u1EDF n\xF3 ra xem n\xE0o, mong m\xECnh c\xF3 th\u1EC3
      t\xECm \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\xEC \u0111\xF3 c\xF3 \xEDch"
